{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>本港地區明日（16日，周一）天氣預測：明日早晚有一兩陣微雨，日間短暫時間有陽光。氣溫介乎23°C至26°C。吹微風，漸轉吹和緩偏東風，明日稍後離岸風勢間中清勁。展望周二短暫時間有陽光。星期三北風增強，稍後氣溫顯著下降。本週後期早晚天氣清涼。（天文台）</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T13:41:50.925046+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T12:55:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T03:04:57.043827+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T13:35:24.785653+00:00","content_hash":"f1b22f00938250cef24e6c0a0552693673cfa8f87047a903c044e1b24caa3308","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}